Package: px4-drv-dkms
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Dynamic Kernel Modules Support Team <pkg-dkms-maint@lists.alioth.debian.org>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Provides: px4-drv-modules (= @MODULE_VERSION@)
Depends: dkms (>= 2.1.0.0)
Homepage: https://github.com/tsukumijima/px4_drv
Description: px4_drv driver in DKMS format
 Kernel module sources and firmware for supported PLEX digital TV tuners.
 DKMS builds the module for installed kernels with available headers.
